Mule and whitetail deer-separate hunting
SF0003
seasons.
Sponsored By: Joint Travel, Recreation, Wildlife & Cultural
Resources Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to game and fish; requiring separate hunting licenses and
seasons for mule deer and whitetail deer; making conforming amendments; and
providing for an effective date.
